ium risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Corrected at inspection","finding":"Screen Time Activities - Not Used During Eating or Rest Times: In three classrooms, screen time was being utilized during lunch and nap time. This was corrected in each classroom when the screens were turned off and music was provided.","topic":"facilities","source_record_id":"1026326827","violation_type_title":"Screen Time Activities - Not Used During Eating or Rest Times (26 TAC §746.2207(c)(4))","topic_label":"Facilities & equipment"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-173354-i20260526-v5","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-501-a-8","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-173354-i20260526","date":"2026-05-26","original_code":"746.501(a)(8)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2026-06-25","finding":"Written Operational Policies - Suspension and Expulsion: The operational policies did not have suspension and expulsion procedures.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026446993","violation_type_title":"Written Operational Policies - Suspension and Expulsion (26 TAC §746.501(a)(8))","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-173354-i20260526-v6","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-501-a-26","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-173354-i20260526","date":"2026-05-26","original_code":"746.501(a)(26)","severity":"medium","severity_label":"Medium risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2026-06-25","finding":"Written Operational Policies - Preventing and Responding to Abuse and Neglect: The operational policies did not include all the required information for abuse and neglect.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026486968","violation_type_title":"Written Operational Policies - Preventing and Responding to Abuse and Neglect (26 TAC §746.501(a)(26))","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-173354-i20260526-v7","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-1107-2","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-173354-i20260526","date":"2026-05-26","original_code":"746.1107(2)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2026-06-25","finding":"Additional Minimum Qualifications for Caregivers - HS Diploma, Equivalent, Certification of Completion: Two caregivers did not have a high school diploma in their files","topic":"staffing","source_record_id":"1026407183","violation_type_title":"Additional Minimum Qualifications for Caregivers - HS Diploma, Equivalent, Certification of Completion (26 TAC §746.1107(2))","topic_label":"Staff qualifications & clearances"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-173354-i20260526-v8","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-5617-a-2","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-173354-i20260526","date":"2026-05-26","original_code":"746.5617(a)(2)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2026-06-25","finding":"Required Equipment in Vehicles - Emergency Medical Information: In the transportation log/binder, each child had all the required information except the required emergency medical information.","topic":"fire","source_record_id":"1026446995","violation_type_title":"Required Equipment in Vehicles - Emergency Medical Information (26 TAC §746.5617(a)(2))","topic_label":"Fire safety & emergency drills"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-173354-i20260526-v9","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-3401-a","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-173354-i20260526","date":"2026-05-26","original_code":"746.3401(a)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2026-06-16","finding":"Annual Sanitation Inspection: An annual sanitation inspection was not conducted for the current year. The last inspection was on 4/30/2025 expiring in 4/30/2026.","topic":"sanitation","source_record_id":"1026367068","violation_type_title":"Annual Sanitation Inspection (26 TAC §746.3401(a))","topic_label":"Sanitation & hygiene"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-173354-i20260526-v10","violation_type_id":"t